{"id":1030201,"chapter_id":1030201,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"X月4日，情报机关锁定了辛迪加已知最后一批狂厄结晶的下落。同日，MBCC成立针对该批狂厄结晶的特别行动组。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"X月6日，在MBCC局长的亲自领导下，特别行动组突袭了一处地下据点，成功击溃并抓获了在此的万灵会势力。然而，行动组未能在该据点找到目标中的狂厄结晶。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"X月7日-X月16日，特别行动组持续在辛迪加追查万灵会残余势力。MBCC于一周内抓捕、审问了近两百人。但由于该组织人员庞杂，未能获得有效情报。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"X月16日，XX街区爆发小规模狂厄感染。MBCC在其中一名死者身上发现了少量狂厄结晶。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"X月18日，MBCC在一次突击行动中抓获了三名潜逃的万灵会成员。这三人在后续审查中声称：早在十天前，万灵会持有的狂厄结晶就已失窃。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"而犯人，正是长期盘踞于辛迪加的另一组织——流浪儿。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，科希已经就位。您随时可以开始。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"知道了。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"你合上桌上的文件，深吸一口气，努力对抗着疲倦。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"即便如此，你起身的时候，前额叶处传来的阵阵胀痛还是令你险些站不稳脚跟。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……需要先休息一会儿吗？您已经快两天没睡了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"好不容易有了线索，不能在这种时候懈怠。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"何况，狂厄结晶的问题不解决，也没法睡个好觉。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我明白了……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"像是想起了什么，夜莺又出声提醒道：","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……请您不要对科希掉以轻心。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"你理解夜莺想表达的意思：不要因抱有不切实际的期待与仁慈。在一个“孩子”之前，科希首先是一个极其危险的狂厄级禁闭者。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"不用担心，我会处理好的。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"眼见你走入审查室，科希只是轻轻抬了一下眼，很快又看向别处。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1030201},{"step":21,"content":"在卤素灯的照射下，她的肤色显现出病态般的苍白，与眼睑下沉重的阴影形成极为鲜明的对比。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1030201},{"step":22,"content":"实际上，不用夜莺提醒，甚至不用提及她狂厄级禁闭者的身份，单单看这副外貌，你都能判断出她绝非普通的“小鬼”。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1030201},{"step":23,"options":["尝试关心科希","直入正题"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"drawing":1030201,"choices":[{"text":"尝试关心科希","goto":26},{"text":"直入正题","goto":33}]},{"step":24,"content":"你看上去气色不太好。来管理局之后没有好好休息吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1030202},{"step":25,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1030202},{"step":26,"content":"回答你的是一声嗤笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1030202},{"step":27,"speaker":"科希","content":"看看你自己吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1030202},{"step":28,"content":"你知道自己现在看上去很糟糕。但这句话和“关心”毫无关系，而是一种鲜明的警告信号。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1030202},{"step":29,"content":"果然，对这些辛迪加出身的禁闭者来说，在对话刚开始时就表示关心无异于示弱。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1030202},{"step":30,"content":"严峻的生存环境让他们本能地对“善意”有所戒备。或许以强硬的态度开场更为合适。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1030202,"next":[35]},{"step":31,"content":"对这些辛迪加出身的禁闭者来说，在对话刚开始时就表示关心无异于示弱。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1030200},{"step":32,"content":"强硬的态度或许更有利于与之交流，前提是别过分刺激他们——毕竟面对狂厄级的禁闭者，即便有枷锁，也并非百分百安全。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1030200},{"step":33,"content":"你深吸一口气，努力保持着大脑的清明，接着切入了正题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1030200},{"step":34,"content":"我们来聊聊流浪儿吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1030200},{"step":35,"speaker":"科希","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1030203},{"step":36,"content":"科希没有回应，但你从她脸上看到了一种介乎警戒和威胁之间的表情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1030203},{"step":37,"content":"她不喜欢从你嘴里听到“流浪儿”这三个字。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1030203},{"step":38,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":39,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":40,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":41,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":42,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":43,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":44,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":45,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":40,"course":6,"drawing":1030203},{"step":46,"content":"你将这份报告递到了科希面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1030203},{"step":47,"content":"流浪儿的“业务范畴”还真是不小。如果只看这份报告的话，我会觉得这是一个BR-004之前就存在的帮派。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1030203},{"step":48,"content":"流浪儿中的几位禁闭者，更是做下了不少连大人都办不到大事……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1030203},{"step":49,"speaker":"科希","content":"所以呢，你想说什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1030203},{"step":50,"content":"科希甚至连看都没看面前的报告一眼，皱着眉打断了你的描述。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1030203},{"step":51,"content":"没什么，我只是觉得你们和普通的孩子截然不同，你们很厉害。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1030203},{"step":52,"content":"你很厉害。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1030203},{"step":53,"speaker":"科希","content":"和我有什么关系？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1030203},{"step":54,"content":"你不就是流浪儿的首领吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1030203},{"step":55,"speaker":"科希","content":"你从哪里听到的消息？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1030203},{"step":56,"content":"当然是亲自问过了流浪儿的成员……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1030203},{"step":57,"content":"这句话一说出口，你突然就感到空气变得紧绷起来。科希的脸色阴沉得骇人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1030203},{"step":58,"content":"别担心，我“问”他们的方式和现在问你的方式不同。毕竟流浪儿的问题此前一直没有牵扯到狂厄，不归MBCC管辖。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1030203},{"step":59,"content":"他们没有说你的名字，而是告诉我，让我滚远些，别在他们的地盘撒野。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1030203},{"step":60,"content":"我要是敢惹到流浪儿，流浪儿的“守护神”就一定会找上门，让我“永远消失”。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1030203},{"step":61,"content":"科希有些狐疑地看着你，身边那种说不清道不明的危险气息渐渐褪去。沉默片刻后，她冷冷地说道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1030200},{"step":62,"speaker":"科希","content":"他们在骗你。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1030200},{"step":63,"content":"他们或许有理由骗我，但那些帮派成员不会。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1030200},{"step":64,"content":"我的人审问了执委会控制下的二十多个前黑帮成员——柳生、红隼、万灵会都有。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1030200},{"step":65,"content":"想听听看他们对流浪儿的评价吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1030200},{"step":66,"speaker":"科希","content":"没兴趣。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1030201},{"step":67,"content":"停顿了一下，她又强调道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1030201},{"step":68,"speaker":"科希","content":"我不想知道。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1030201},{"step":69,"speaker":"黑帮成员","content":"“渣滓、兔崽子、混球、害虫……”","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201064,"trial_step":64},{"step":70,"speaker":"黑帮成员","content":"“但是无论这群小**干了什么垃圾事儿，只要毛还没长齐，会画那个鬼一样的涂鸦，就会有个**的禁闭者罩着。”","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201065,"trial_step":65},{"step":71,"speaker":"黑帮成员","content":"“会从影子里窜来窜去，根本对付不了。而且跟**的疯狗一样，一点道理不讲。辛迪加的帮派都在她手上吃过大亏。”","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201066,"trial_step":66},{"step":72,"content":"在你转述完黑帮的“控诉”后，科希的反应有些出乎你的意料。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1030202},{"step":73,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵呵呵，真好笑啊。一群只擅长烧杀抢掠的大人，觉得几个小孩子不讲道理……他们究竟是以什么样的立场说出这种话的？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1030202},{"step":74,"speaker":"科希","content":"就凭他们过去这些年里一直是辛迪加的“统治者”，一直作威作福惯了，现在有人能对付得了他们了，就委屈到找你哭鼻子了？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1030202},{"step":75,"content":"我知道黑帮在辛迪加的所作所为，但这与他们的证词无关。流浪儿的守护者，那些黑帮描述的禁闭者，就是你。对吧？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1030202},{"step":76,"content":"又或许，你可以告诉我，在辛迪加，有其他能力与你相似，同时有动机频繁帮助流浪儿的禁闭者吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1030202},{"step":77,"content":"科希有些玩味地看着你，回答道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1030200},{"step":78,"speaker":"科希","content":"所以你真的信了他们？相信一群在辛迪加无恶不作的黑帮成员被一个不知来历的小鬼吓破了胆子？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1030200},{"step":79,"content":"科希的回应让你一时有些语塞。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1030200},{"step":80,"content":"至少在这件事上，他们没理由说谎，也不存在串供的可能。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1030200},{"step":81,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵呵，是吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1030200},{"step":82,"content":"科希已经失去了和你继续争辩下去的兴致。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1030201},{"step":83,"content":"你大可以继续否认。不过无论如何，你都与流浪儿脱不了干系，不是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1030201},{"step":84,"speaker":"科希","content":"啧……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1030201},{"step":85,"speaker":"科希","content":"你想怎么样，要用我去要挟流浪儿吗？那你可打错算盘了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1030202},{"step":86,"content":"不，我没有打算要挟流浪儿。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1030202},{"step":87,"content":"你收起桌上的报告，直视科希，露出一个微笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1030202},{"step":88,"content":"无论你是不是他们的保护者或是领袖，当然，你是的话更好，事情会变得容易很多。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1030202},{"step":89,"content":"我有一件非常重要的事情需要向流浪儿的领袖求证。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1030202},{"step":90,"speaker":"科希","content":"我对当传话筒没有兴趣。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1030201},{"step":91,"content":"事关流浪儿，乃至整个辛迪加的安全，我希望你能配合。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1030201},{"step":92,"content":"科希没有再说什么。她知道你是个难缠的对手，但对于你郑重其事的提问，她则表现出一副兴致缺缺的样子，甚至没有看向你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1030201},{"step":93,"content":"但你并没有感到焦急，你手上有着足以让她动摇的情报。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1030201},{"step":94,"content":"14天前，MBCC发现万灵会的残余势力手中保存着一批狂厄结晶。但在清缴了绝大多数万灵会剩余成员后，我们依旧没能找到它们。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1030201},{"step":95,"content":"当听到“狂厄结晶”这四个字时，科希明显皱了一下眉。很显然，她知道这玩意儿是什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1030202},{"step":96,"content":"考虑到科希与流浪儿的关系，你知道，你的下一句话将改变这次审查的风向。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1030202},{"step":97,"content":"我们有充足的理由相信，流浪儿从万灵会手中窃取了这批狂厄结晶。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1030202},{"step":98,"speaker":"科希","content":"？！","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1030203},{"step":99,"content":"科希猛地抬起头，露出了难以置信的表情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1030203},{"step":100,"content":"但这个表情转瞬即逝，她很快又冷静下来。她微微低下头，以一种近乎阴森的语气说道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1030202},{"step":101,"speaker":"科希","content":"你想开玩笑的话最好换一个讲。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1030202},{"step":102,"content":"表面过分的强硬意味着内心的动摇，这则情报已经完全超出了她的预期。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1030202},{"step":103,"content":"艾恩","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1030202},{"step":104,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":105,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":106,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":107,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":108,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":109,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":110,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":99,"course":6,"drawing":1030202},{"step":111,"content":"“自X月起，流浪儿开始变得异常活跃。作案的频率、恶劣程度越发提高，甚至开始有组织有预谋地进行非法活动。”","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1030200},{"step":112,"content":"“X月18日，管理局抓获三名万灵会的残党，这三人声称狂厄结晶已被流浪儿盗走。以下是具体证词……”","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1030200},{"step":113,"speaker":"科希","content":"别念了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1030203},{"step":114,"content":"科希死死盯着桌上的文件，她的声音阴沉又艰涩。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1030203},{"step":115,"content":"所以，你对这件事一无所知，对吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1030203},{"step":116,"content":"科希没有正面回答。她的表情阴沉得不像个孩子。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1030203},{"step":117,"speaker":"科希","content":"……你们对流浪儿动手了？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1030203},{"step":118,"content":"没有。流浪儿的成员们非常机警，我们很难和他们正面接触。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1030203},{"step":119,"speaker":"科希","content":"你不知道流浪儿的状况？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1030203},{"step":120,"content":"的确。所以我希望你能提供相应的情报，我需要向他们求证这一系列事件的真实性。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1030203},{"step":121,"content":"你能告诉我他们在哪里吗？或者提供有效的交流方式？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1030203},{"step":122,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵呵。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1030202},{"step":123,"content":"科希冷笑着，仿佛是在嘲弄你的异想天开。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1030202},{"step":124,"content":"那我换个问题。有没有可能你不在的这段时间里，有其他势力指使或是胁迫流浪儿……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1030202},{"step":125,"speaker":"科希","content":"不可能。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1030200},{"step":126,"speaker":"科希","content":"他们没这个胆量。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1030200},{"step":127,"content":"科希的语气很平静，仿佛只是在陈述事实。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1030200},{"step":128,"content":"那么还有另一种可能——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1030200},{"step":129,"content":"流浪儿本身计划了这次行动，从万灵会的手里偷走了那批狂厄结晶。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1030200},{"step":130,"speaker":"科希","content":"……这只是你的猜测罢了。流浪儿只是一群孩子而已，他们没这个本事。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1030200},{"step":131,"content":"相比之前无比笃定的否认，这次科希出现了很短暂的迟疑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1030200},{"step":132,"content":"可是情报显示，流浪儿在偷盗方面完全不输于成熟的偷盗团伙，从黑帮手里偷走狂厄结晶并非没有可能。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1030200},{"step":133,"content":"他们完全有可能趁你不在的时候自作主张……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1030200},{"step":134,"speaker":"科希","content":"我们不是白痴。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1030200},{"step":135,"content":"……看来你的确很清楚狂厄结晶的危害。但你能保证至少上千人的流浪儿每一个都清楚吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1030200},{"step":136,"content":"退一步讲，即便他们也都清楚，但如果他们在动手之前不知道那是狂厄结晶呢？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1030200},{"step":137,"speaker":"旁白","content":"科希的脸色越发难看起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1030203},{"step":138,"content":"我也希望自己不用怀疑流浪儿，科希。但我没法排除他们的嫌疑。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1030203},{"step":139,"content":"一旦流浪儿直接接触到了狂厄结晶，事情就不是他们能够控制的了……我们不能对此坐视不管。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1030203},{"step":140,"speaker":"科希","content":"不能坐视不管……呵呵呵呵……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1030203},{"step":141,"speaker":"科希","content":"那些无依无靠的废物小鬼在辛迪加等死的时候，你怎么不来管管呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1030203},{"step":142,"content":"并非歇斯底里的尖叫，也不是什么声泪俱下的控诉，而是一种冷漠、嘲弄的态度，仿佛只是顽劣的孩童在说些恶劣的玩笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1030203},{"step":143,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1030203},{"step":144,"speaker":"科希","content":"非得等到我们找到活下去的办法了，你们这些“正义人士”才终于舍得出现了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1030203},{"step":145,"speaker":"科希","content":"一上来就告诉我们要以大局为重，要为辛迪加的安危着想……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1030203},{"step":146,"speaker":"科希","content":"你们的大局，和流浪儿又有什么关系？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1030203},{"step":147,"content":"科希脸上的表情却与“有趣”毫不相干。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1030203},{"step":148,"speaker":"科希","content":"不过我还是得承认，先是治安局，再是执委会，再到你……","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1030203},{"step":149,"speaker":"科希","content":"从跟黑帮狼狈为奸，到当我们不存在，再到“温柔地沟通”……至少你们学会装装样子了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1030203},{"step":150,"speaker":"科希","content":"但你和他们没什么两样，都只是想着利用我们罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1030203},{"step":151,"content":"不，我没有这样想过。我只是想提供帮助。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1030203},{"step":152,"speaker":"科希","content":"哦？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201141,"trial_step":141,"drawing":1030202},{"step":153,"content":"科希的声音伴随着阴冷的嘲弄。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201142,"trial_step":142,"drawing":1030202},{"step":154,"speaker":"科希","content":"如果不是牵扯到狂厄结晶，你还会管流浪儿的死活吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201143,"trial_step":143,"drawing":1030202},{"step":155,"content":"没有等你回答，科希抬起头，再度看向你的眼睛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201144,"trial_step":144,"drawing":1030200},{"step":156,"speaker":"科希","content":"你不会，你们都不会。只有我们自己会管自己。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1030200},{"step":157,"speaker":"科希","content":"你们这些大人能提供的最大“帮助”，就是离流浪儿远一点，别再来烦我们。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1030200},{"step":158,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1030200},{"step":159,"content":"嗯，我理解你的想法，也相信你与流浪儿之间的羁绊。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1030200},{"step":160,"content":"但你真的能确定，流浪儿与这次狂厄结晶的事件无关吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1030200},{"step":161,"content":"科希面部的肌肉微微抽搐了一下，接着抿紧了嘴唇。可即便如此，还是掩盖不了自己的眼神。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1030202},{"step":162,"content":"她对成年人的不信任，对流浪儿的袒护，都抵不上对同伴安危的担忧。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1030202},{"step":163,"content":"你有没有考虑过，如果流浪儿中有人真的偷了狂厄结晶，该怎么办？流浪儿真的能在这种情况下独自处理好吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1030202},{"step":164,"content":"你的话终于动摇了科希的态度，她脸上的焦虑已经掩饰不住了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1030202},{"step":165,"content":"科希，在这件事上我们并非是对立的，完全可以合作。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1030202},{"step":166,"speaker":"科希","content":"不需要合作，我一个人就可以解决。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1030202},{"step":167,"content":"……我知道，你没办法轻易相信我，觉得我想要利用你。但这件事真的不是你，或者流浪儿能够独自解决的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1030202},{"step":168,"content":"单单说狂厄结晶，如果没有相应的设备，你们甚至无法做无害化处理。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1030202},{"step":169,"content":"你按了按头侧不住跳动的血管，耐心地解释着。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1030202},{"step":170,"content":"流浪儿……归根结底都只是群孩子，无论有没有接触过狂厄结晶，他们都是最容易被裹挟的一群人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1030202},{"step":171,"content":"我不希望他们面对这种程度的危险——至少这一点上，我们利害一致，不是吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201160,"trial_step":160,"drawing":1030202},{"step":172,"content":"我需要你的帮助。更准确地说，流浪儿需要你的帮助。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1030202},{"step":173,"content":"科希紧锁着眉头，思索着你说的话，许久都没有出声。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1030202},{"step":174,"content":"在有些过分漫长的压抑和沉默之后，她终于还是开口了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1030200},{"step":175,"speaker":"科希","content":"……一个人。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201164,"trial_step":164,"drawing":1030200},{"step":176,"speaker":"科希","content":"你一个人，还有我，其他人不许跟着。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1030200},{"step":177,"content":"听到这里，你不禁抚着胸口长出了一口气。耗尽心力的劝说与毫无保留的真诚最终没有白费，你甚至感觉多日的疲惫在此刻都一扫而空。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1030200},{"step":178,"content":"看到你这样的反应，科希冷笑着说道：","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1030202},{"step":179,"speaker":"科希","content":"别高兴得太早。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1030202},{"step":180,"speaker":"科希","content":"如果让我发现你在骗我，或者你敢做出任何伤害流浪儿的事……影子会跟着你的。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1030202},{"step":181,"content":"你微笑着摆了摆手。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201170,"trial_step":170,"drawing":1030202},{"step":182,"content":"这种事情不会发生的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1030202},{"step":183,"speaker":"科希","content":"呵呵，别太相信你的枷锁……局长大人。","voice":["vo_trial_30201_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_crache_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130201172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1030202}]}